{"3782120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NEODITRONIX", "steam_appid": 3782120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NEODITRONIX</i> is the dreamcore rhythm experience, available as a web-based, standalone freeware title. <strong>HEAR</strong> various sounds with frenetic rhythm gameplay, utilizing unique lane lasers. <strong>RECOLLECT</strong> memories with a full narrative exploring lost dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KINETIC RHYTHMIC ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/extras/9148ab6f66b1a579f2c252c228d3fe56.avif?t=1766646865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge yourself</strong> with traditional rhythm arcade 4k action, flipped upside down with a unique lane-shifting mechanic. Use your mouse to move the lanes along the line while handling the 4 lanes simultaneously! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 3 (<i>?</i>) different difficulties: Lite, Neon, and Enigma, for those looking to set the adversity to their liking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HAUNTING, DREAMY ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/extras/8fb5516145aedb12a821682d8d85209a.avif?t=1766646865\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the dreamworld.</strong> Awake in a spaceship with no memories and a strange, mysterious companion in tow, hear <strong>Shiro</strong>'s past in  2D side-scrolling vignettes in the Adventure mode. Uncover the secrets of Shiro's past and the universe surrounding him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to rhythm games, narrative games, and the SKY HOUR WORKS doujin circle, published as a part of our  6th anniversary!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including playable tracks from takehirotei, Tatsuoto, Kyotsugyon, DeBisco, Frums, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates will include new story content, accessibility features, playable tracks, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creature</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NEODITRONIX</i> is the dreamcore rhythm experience, available as a web-based, standalone freeware title. <strong>HEAR</strong> various sounds with frenetic rhythm gameplay, utilizing unique lane lasers. <strong>RECOLLECT</strong> memories with a full narrative exploring lost dreams.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KINETIC RHYTHMIC ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/extras/9148ab6f66b1a579f2c252c228d3fe56.avif?t=1766646865\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge yourself</strong> with traditional rhythm arcade 4k action, flipped upside down with a unique lane-shifting mechanic. Use your mouse to move the lanes along the line while handling the 4 lanes simultaneously! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 3 (<i>?</i>) different difficulties: Lite, Neon, and Enigma, for those looking to set the adversity to their liking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A HAUNTING, DREAMY ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/extras/8fb5516145aedb12a821682d8d85209a.avif?t=1766646865\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the dreamworld.</strong> Awake in a spaceship with no memories and a strange, mysterious companion in tow, hear <strong>Shiro</strong>'s past in  2D side-scrolling vignettes in the Adventure mode. Uncover the secrets of Shiro's past and the universe surrounding him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to rhythm games, narrative games, and the SKY HOUR WORKS doujin circle, published as a part of our  6th anniversary!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including playable tracks from takehirotei, Tatsuoto, Kyotsugyon, DeBisco, Frums, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future updates will include new story content, accessibility features, playable tracks, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >creature</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "THE DREAMCORE RHYTHM EXPERIENCE", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/48129446b88678763c10fb0c25125f2c35810f05/header.jpg?t=1766646865", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/d3f49b96a9167c13beaf0e022b63cc4fbd225d3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766646865", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782120/d3f49b96a9167c13beaf0e022b63cc4fbd225d3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766646865", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any Intel / AMD 3.00 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GT 1030 or Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any Intel i7 / AMD Ryzen 3.00 GHz Proc